  run() executes, so no file is read for a conflicting invocation.
- --action and --scenario stay required whenever --resume is absent.
- --action with --resume is optional and is passed to stage::resume as R0.
- Every core-level failure on a /2 path (bounded read, strict decode, load,
  admission, evaluation) prints a labelled stage rejection via print_stage_result.

